      (r4-xrun xs ys xd yd sp sb dp db us a k W W2 len jb1 wd J E0 o2v xg (MkXD xd yd wd ld ld2 ud ud2 wdb) nv nb s g sn (rmd-init n w wd nw dw) P ps))
